<title>SINGAPORE: Intraco 1996 net profit falls 61.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Intraco 1996 net profit falls 61.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996 (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		     6.19   vs   16.15</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)	     5.0    vs    8.0</p>
<p>    Group share (cents)	  6.41   vs   16.74</p>
<p>    Turnover		     677.09   vs  917.81</p>
<p>    Dividend income		0.82   vs    0.81</p>
<p>    Other income		   2.39   vs    2.47</p>
<p>    Interest expense	     2.89   vs    4.66</p>
<p>    Associates		     8.45   vs   10.85</p>
<p>    Pretax profit		 12.55   vs   26.70</p>
<p>    Tax				5.21   vs    8.65</p>
<p>    Minorities		    (1.15)  vs   (1.90)</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	     (0.04)  vs   (0.19)</p>
<p>Note - Diversified trading group Intraco Ltd said its performance was affected by a significant reduction in contribution from its automobile business and a decline in contribution from associates.</p>
<p>--Singapore newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
</text>
